@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title RestroVibes - Authentication & Access Control

actor Client
actor Restaurateur
actor Admin

participant "Web Interface" as Web
participant "AuthController" as Auth
participant "ScoringEngine" as Score
participant "Database" as DB
participant "EmailService" as Mail

== Registration ==

Client -> Web : Sign up\n(name, email, password, phone, role)
Web -> Auth : POST /api/auth/register
Auth -> Auth : Validate roles:\n["client", "restaurateurs"]
Auth -> DB : Hash password (bcrypt)\n+ INSERT INTO users
DB --> Auth : User created
Auth -> Auth : Generate JWT access (1h)\n+ refresh token (7d)
Auth --> Web : 201 { user, tokens }
Web -> Web : Store in sessionStorage

== Login ==

Client -> Web : Enter email + password + role
Web -> Auth : POST /api/auth/login
Auth -> DB : SELECT WHERE email AND role
DB --> Auth : User found
Auth -> Auth : bcrypt.compare()
Auth -> Auth : Generate JWT pair
Auth --> Web : { accessToken, refreshToken }
Web -> Web : Store tokens + redirect

== Token Refresh ==

Web -> Auth : Request fails -> 401
Web -> Auth : POST /api/auth/refresh-token
Auth -> DB : Validate refresh token
DB --> Auth : Valid
Auth -> Auth : Generate new tokens
Auth -> DB : Update refresh token
Auth --> Web : { new tokens }
Web -> Web : Update storage + retry

== Password Reset ==

Client -> Web : Enter email
Web -> Auth : POST /api/auth/forgot-password
Auth -> DB : Find user by email
Auth -> Auth : crypto.randomBytes(32)\nExpiry: now + 10 min
Auth -> DB : Store reset_token + expiry
Auth -> Mail : Send reset email
Mail --> Client : Reset link sent
note right of Mail : Dev: log to console\nProd: SMTP
Auth --> Web : 200 (prevents enumeration)

Client -> Web : Click link -> new password
Web -> Auth : POST /api/auth/reset-password\n{ token, password }
Auth -> DB : Validate token + expiry
DB --> Auth : Valid
Auth -> Auth : Hash new password
Auth -> DB : Update password\n+ clear reset token
Auth --> Web : 200 Reset successful

== Role-Based Enforcement ==

note over Web,DB
Client:
  + Create/cancel own appointments
  + Extend own appointments
  + View own history + rate

Restaurateur:
  + Confirm/complete/cancel own bookings
  + Mark arrival + no-show
  + Manage own tables + services

Admin:
  + Bypass all ownership checks
  + Delete users + backfill penalties
  + Manual lottery resolution
end note

@enduml
